Tsingi wrote:

> OK, I have read that they have a healing attack.  Anything I should
> know? Remove my CloakoMR?

You need to remove *all* armour, and unwield your weapon. Otherwise,
they'll just hit you for damage.

That's why you want to do this in Sokoban, preferably on the up stairs.
That way, they cannot escape by stairs, they cannot teleport away from
you, and *you* may escape if something nasty would accidentally be
generated on the level and manage to reach the upstairs despity you
locking the door.

